090352.210: [09:03:52]    by bash(1) at the corresponding phases of the link, most commonly used
090352.210: [09:03:52]    to configure DNS. The string `%i' is expanded to INTERFACE.
090352.210: [09:03:52]  - SaveConfig: if set to `true', the configuration is saved from the current
090352.210: [09:03:52]    state of the interface upon shutdown.
090352.210: [09:03:52]
